* ''The Codex pool line softens to 20%'' (operator, 2026-11-07: //"Set the codex pool limit down to 20% (its really a soft limit)"//). A lead, build or research seat launches until 20% of the weekly pool remains, so each used-percent line stands at 80% and meets the floor; a read seat keeps its own floor. The line bounds a fresh launch, never a running seat, and stands for the operator to move again (`pool-line`, PR #198; <<~ loulou uri=`lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/docs/pono/seat-harness#/the-spend-guard`>>).

